    {
      "sha256": "9588192fefcacab3fb93a1d7c8f3695bde2d2058a5687c5a026e87dc744f9e87",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/rubrics.md",
      "text": "Avoid a scoring loop that only paraphrases the same evidence to reach a threshold."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3857e004778607391c8ce074ff2fd4a254cf19ac06676f9841d5c137c3964356",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/rubrics.md",
      "text": "a missing critical compatibility result must still hold at G2/G3; a polished pitch"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "62e0fc3c639a76d16c461285edde56d932c05d4b19679e2945f37c53310870a9",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/rubrics.md",
      "text": "must apply these distinctions and compare against actual team exemplars. A"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5de577c15d0e80dfb17c77913b3e6ce8298d4f95935417a5ca1ea1a2a5dc623e",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "The host must restrict accepted state, policy, reviewer assignment and this CLI"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c1ed5f64fc47d0e9b224f8721b095a192f31be7994256ed6446b4e910cef6d30",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "to the controller. Workers receive their candidate directory only. The runtime"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "348771966236115315061db34aad13627fb14e045d251e899bd09a2d663f261b",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "The host must quiesce candidate/source writers during seal and acceptance. The"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "efa607fdd32ee9a66aa4cf2198b903b27206fc57b0984dd12ec0fd7ed719dbe7",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "files. Hash rechecks do not provide an OS snapshot of a changing source tree."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b4000988cc0e3b642b9e51432b596a65f5000233d0b1628ffcbd635891f6bb73",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "evidence and context evidence in `prepare`. Assignment/context files must be"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f323493dc1774ef9f64c3ca7124543ed8bb071418923b194846180c6563a3844",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "is required at every gate, including G3. An author-written label or a test fixture"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7c7652fb3b58bf1b2d5a61f4bd30fb17ca65d66750ef07da775b054a87a7e333",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "and `pass` strings are never interpreted as proof of truth. Missing/failing/"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "59eaee507c905c903801e0cc54efb3de1621d3108a3c1a0af0d434f81f007178",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "are mechanical regression evidence only. They are not independent review, a"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2737279cbc73079dbfa7bc898d6314e39e9076746f4f467088d0f2e02a6ff0fa",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "are filesystem paths. `--policy` must be inside the run. Absolute/nested symlink"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "32def7740b68f4e8f6b16960b4b2f02b201fed52463de7297e13fb05b8bfd0a7",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "# Dispatch the author only now. Its writes go to candidates/G0-intake-a1/."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "447534204a6f37c35a8fd3261fc74f13a614de49721520c54918235c98c24bde",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "\"original_constraints\": [\"Preserve the supplied problem; do not choose a solution in the frame.\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1a212b2df9f15bef59c7c03c2b8ecff8b86e046e86ca575c5e660bdfb07f3baf",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "\"source_access_scope\": \"Only listed sources and explicitly approved source inspection\","
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ff0b73e069cb2d612da33035e92f8a43687e9150894218bda91de2f76aa2e962",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "required outputs/predicates, accepted question/decision snapshots and return schema."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "0870a7ac254a0594b7fb659c482c44d46e944064ab3ba3ff1f8d5c612de2423f",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "The directory must not exist before assignment. `seal` checks required outputs"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2f5eebb79caa9fd2271242662a0263cca3ae28f330a678e64a4c3f1a2e06387f",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "later stages may add files but must reopen the owning stage to change earlier prose."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7e8ffcf5391d5e024e9e44db41c635cd8e86b4d5bc211b1b25106c56f429e671",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "| Gate | Required new artifacts | Mandatory semantic IDs mapped to gates.md |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2bc526741ab3b502cb5157d4127f74d94cb48342ba492c8aece04b39d7779a51",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "is integer `1`. `reviewer` must match the assigned identity. For acceptance,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2f9a5cb0ea1ced039e9f6a4dd140c532e286a9a8ee27856d484babdb4ad845ae",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "`assessments` has exactly one entry for every required predicate:"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c8e9784046bf4477d0c8cc6e1dfea9e72f12d7c9f63dced0645826292eae017c",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "This fragment illustrates shape only; it is not a review or a usable full receipt."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "294f00edb021ca62f2bb5c2a073c4e9f162b1e07844f3daa9b74753b47c9e3b2",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "and must be >=4; category means are reporting only. Supply means without display rounding"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7ad1eb577ceb26c4709cb99fb62a021d40dbefa3e801fb5f48fbaceb83abacfd",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "local diagram pixel inspection, even for a JSON-only delivery request."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4f5c3e2e5d768a4caf4b9dd090677a617395320124ae4c32b02fa30f97a93599",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "mandatory; the reviewer must assess whether evidence meets it. `evidence` and"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "87d0dc404801626db53988d0823db4984c49bdf380f4823919b9aa19b0df71c9",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "it never reconstructs acceptance by guessing from orphan objects. Preserve the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "acd2858a663042cbee4ab01c68a198033cba0b3e52f48c2386e8d2c2778a80f1",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "Unreferenced interrupted writes are not authority and are never auto-promoted."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c0fa270b4f37a223da3d5c6dffb868940cf6fa3be412881bbe4aa20225484396",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "obtains the required target permissions and emits local evidence."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d303aa43b00f1a80f93ff05074624157b5b4f6f85490485843c148219ff4cfe4",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "already-created target and read it back before recording a result. Do not create"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d604a2b6ccd3257f46927a01aad2008da997d0ecf2d39c55ae68d78c4ad6a786",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/references/runtime.md",
      "text": "and cannot be substituted with `structured`. JSON-only runs can reach G4 with these"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "729a49567457abef665e922e799f02d50cbaeafdb598a3521e7aaadaf703318b",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "\"\"\"Controller-operated shaping journal. Python 3.11+, standard library only."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "104d690baa6d657d78c7ff5d8f22c3ed86c1603d74a7f4d6ab0d01e8e895a525",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "\"\"\"Persistent state cannot be verified; do not guess success.\"\"\""
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4d7851843cb32082e89cd8dfd7c156ee4643c606ef2c7552dcc08dbf8397accb",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "def shape(value, required, optional=()):"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "fb4e290ea98ed09616c8394d012d5328aef24e5de95e86d1803f60bc990ac9da",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(set(required) <= value.keys(), f\"missing fields: {sorted(set(required) - value.keys())}\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9eb06e38c76f4ac2753f49143d9715f9c52c1d2444fd4d352a67250f244ef897",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(value.keys() <= set(required) | set(optional), \"unknown fields\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "82e2eb9a66abcbd340fb15ecbfc31617a711ea2903f58a22fa5f53565b916e97",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(path.is_relative_to(self.root), \"policy must be under run root\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c5f40ae4c67cc0b64f05096c988ead91bf4c2287c7271cc6acb18d5aa78e839c",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(reviewer[\"independent\"] is True and reviewer[\"identity\"] != spec[\"author\"], \"independent reviewer required before dispatch\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "50c9093138685b4f0989650272b4bee9f03217c11e59c5e1f7a2e3885c2539ca",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(reviewer[key] in spec[\"inputs\"], f\"reviewer {key} must be a hashed input\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e0f7609a0ce21e8dd3209285b041ecd01b36ea7fc7604302a2af7783bd27bf5b",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "required = set(state[\"policy\"][\"gates\"][order[\"gate\"]][\"required_outputs\"]) | {\"questions.json\", \"decisions.json\"}"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4b340cab04a3990f2da6c2ae6bf9795aee7b0ce2ada0ceb09b66332ae4479d75",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(required <= files.keys(), f\"missing outputs: {sorted(required - files.keys())}\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e2ddb20b925316cf0b1ebab7378f9c78dc41a0380fd34d309a5d324144b2df60",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(isinstance(questions, list) and isinstance(decisions, list), \"registers must be JSON arrays\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b2449f51142b9ea953fadb06b3273c9f9aec82edc048be26df9c77f1c37f1742",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(isinstance(decision[\"details\"], dict), \"decision details must be an object\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3662822f3cf3444779e7ba0903028751b84b80e7416ed76ffa2700b53289dcc6",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(isinstance(q[\"details\"], dict), \"question details must be an object\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ccbe747c8aaf9c7f91df1ab32b51dd561c169cf4876ed4dcda0d34239dd53461",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "and receipt[\"independence_confirmed\"] is True, \"review_pending: independent assessment required\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1b9426c6ce2813bc236b6b8004d5941450445e63614f94a09c36475352d4419b",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(path in files, \"review evidence must be in sealed subject\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c6f8bda4d85df38ac533cd095145294d12d27a2c2ac63e7e7ab6f94373475733",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(isinstance(receipt[\"targets\"], list), \"targets must be an array\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7c424b8820aea4dd07ec8252cb1a57b958585cf89638c088c37f83a1230c0f6f",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(isinstance(target, dict), \"target review must be an object\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7b526cb91616f42b01068905f473ed8f55894a42f54f17580d0fa6420e0d9633",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(found == requested and bool(found), \"missing required delivery targets\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ccbc334e18654a07ed055f724f7b08ed5484ce9656c095c6703ad39d3c5200ba",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(isinstance(receipt, dict), \"receipt must be an object\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "adaa968e29e0574876e385e0f9926229bfc1192711450f24cf041983718ab2ee",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(order[\"seal\"] is not None, \"candidate must be sealed before review\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "29d0ad5196ad872ebe4975b809946b9482cdce13a159052619c63097e7221346",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(old[\"status\"] == \"verified\", \"reconciliation_required: locate/read back existing target; do not create again\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d43d0d24677eafc784d64509a19d9b01cfbd33a2ab8ac7d0e7b1b862a01fe352",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "require(isinstance(parsed, (dict, list)) and parsed, \"JSON target readback must be a nonempty structured document\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2d35ead65f1b5a623869dfa56479c15f99b453390f754042e3dbb8fdcc639a7b",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "sub = parser.add_subparsers(dest=\"command\", required=True)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "33193b96e2bf3c181b5864b07388ea85d5480007c059e6a7e1729995b3a5214c",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--run\", required=True, type=Path, help=\"Controller-owned run directory (no symlinks)\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "85b3f638aa7209dc81551cf6472e3c866de9501c9e3e68f65c8c1894d5458b17",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--expected-version\", required=True, type=int, help=\"Exact state version from status\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "14bf390288743122d9e98163209132671bf199c8f9b36c7b3c050dc774f17f95",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--run-id\", required=True)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "65b8bdc0d7f0678882417b10a8b26487c11aaabf3c0c5edba26332728b61fb75",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--controller\", required=True, help=\"Host-attested label; not authentication\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "98120a7f51fd768dd2db55673034063394b3eee7f26b1c66ece46eeddcb0473a",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--policy\", required=True, type=Path, help=\"Policy JSON inside run root\")"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9f70ed54ec38e4852eb9235aac972770a19d9a8d37fe27fb0357812d5703c707",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "if command == \"prepare\": p.add_argument(\"--spec\", required=True, type=Path)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "52e692b3eed0914d6b5b917c31f26d3d2f386c965ebafe06d745a1e523577d0a",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "if command == \"seal\": p.add_argument(\"--work-order\", required=True)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c15b3b8c86ac7402c21cc21f681d0aedb34f667aaaa45d6c7f44947743ad528f",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "if command == \"accept\": p.add_argument(\"--receipt\", required=True, type=Path)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ba3861a8af5090453bbe95bd6d6e667b221b2d04ab752cf3e097882312fb24e9",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--gate\", choices=GATES, required=True)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "425190a4a7ff1b497768eab65b1c7ed359be93a3b3c208adcfb23d947c993731",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--reason\", required=True)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d1e5f2e1419c6ca9eca41a196b78a9a508a06d8e5ff37f4bee68f9caf8b5f79f",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--surface\", required=True)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e980fb35ea1269559c06383ec61f87f653feaef3f5b57a144561c50948f30c05",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--destination\", required=True)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "60eb171dc1e6444f7366b5bf021517422a98ddd914619216c4eea79cbc2ce4fd",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--operation\", required=True)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "42d0a234b0302be859f4fc11e7c5683098e10410ecccf2c7c7c3a600b561c196",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/scripts/shaping_run.py",
      "text": "p.add_argument(\"--record\", required=True, type=Path)"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "363a83e49fc15c9259b6722596e63ff1e536507b8e8effd9ff788bb1b6d2435c",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"description\": \"Select a definitions entry with $ref. Structural schemas do not authenticate identities, establish semantic truth, verify pixel quality or authorize external actions. The stdlib runtime additionally validates cross-field policy, hashes, paths, predicates, scores, versions and predecessor bindings.\","
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f8f651e0dc9855926e3019774e07d8dcebee2ee6b4a62b279d0b9ade26c46164",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"surface\", \"destination\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "5ac9784d99d97d47fcb0e61cf2d122f6fb93de679df1f527f733c290481b2b10",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"predicates\", \"required_outputs\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d6f6deb45a62c982387b11e11e445e2881b544f1adbad8139b0a63d319c67498",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"required\": [\"schema_version\", \"policy_id\", \"gates\", \"scoring\", \"delivery_targets\", \"references\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4a1abdf6e817419637b4b3e3d85d8d2c23a5b546782fb93777b955154dc98b41",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"gates\", \"rubric\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "6aec50adcf829c11a655d7cd57b3dcbceb9778032625ac61818715e92c1d762a",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"G0\", \"G1\", \"G2\", \"G3\", \"G4\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "aec73698cead78ea15879f9c726e03a9d3ee318cc9b1a284dab2ea8fa8e15549",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"required\": [\"dimensions\", \"minimum_dimension\", \"minimum_overall\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ba9facac86d774769dcd93d452ba46402c4e63a762f3e015f2445d989cceb743",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"required\": [\"identity\", \"independent\", \"assignment_evidence\", \"context_evidence\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f0d9769a7e041a838ebb2890fc4a1a6a65dcec13947d66ed7baf8d0a4055c0ca",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"description\": \"Controller records BEFORE dispatch. Both evidence paths must be in inputs. Runtime compares labels and hashes, not actual host identity or context isolation.\""
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ea44296848e772725953d544c8268aa881ed79923530d9d2eae8b2e38a3cd98d",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"required\": [\"schema_version\", \"work_order_id\", \"gate\", \"author\", \"reviewer\", \"inputs\", \"source_revision\", \"resource_revision\", \"skill_allowlist\", \"original_constraints\", \"assigned_questions\", \"source_access_scope\", \"effort_bound\", \"stop_conditions\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c0ea9a1ab6363f2ee5dc6fda0e499a2d575449575f5686db5abdf9fa74b6bea2",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"required\": [\"id\", \"blocking\", \"in_scope\", \"status\", \"evidence_standard\", \"evidence\", \"decision_id\", \"dependency_evidence\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a716fb56447ed70d5c7696d766882b01861cc26471e98cd658ac02decfa91554",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"description\": \"G2 onward in-scope blockers must be answered with evidence. Exclusion requires in_scope=false, status=excluded, confirmed decision and dependency evidence. IDs cannot disappear or downgrade blocking.\""
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9ab4c03988464536c1a1f2c818fb315732e538b4d8ada4cc4857b7db0783bb8f",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"id\", \"status\", \"authority\", \"reason\", \"evidence\"],"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "efc52be16db61998e24694d288b80980a507c8b2942bd3a49be34d2510155e08",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-quality-shaping-gate/schemas/runtime.schema.json",
      "text": "\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"outcome\", \"evidence_ids\", \"explanation\"],"
    },
    {
